SUMMARY:World Cup Watch Party : USA  vs Türkiye
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nCome join us for the USMNT's 3rd and
  final Group D match against Türkiye. Technically this is a "Dead Rubber"
  match since the US has already won the group. However\, the World Cup onl
 y happens every 4 years\, so we might as well enjoy every minute of action
  we get.\n\nWe'll be meeting at EO's Athletic Club\, which is starting to 
 become my favorite sports bar in the Triangle. The vibe of this place is e
 xcellent and they make some tasty food too.\n\n\\*\\*If you have trouble f
 inding street parking\, the Corcoran Street Parking Garage is free after 7
  on weeknights.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31536
 8009/
